{"rewritten_prompt": "A vertical, cinematic nighttime street portrait shows a single adult woman positioned slightly right of center in a medium close-up from about the waist or lower torso upward. She has a slim build, light-to-medium olive skin tone, an oval face, defined cheekbones, straight nose, full natural lips, and expressive brown eyes looking directly toward the camera with a calm, serious, self-possessed expression. Her short dark brown to black bob haircut falls around jaw length with loose, wind-swept waves and strands crossing her forehead and cheek. Subtle makeup is visible, including softly defined brows, eyeliner or mascara emphasizing the lashes, muted neutral eyeshadow, gentle contouring, and natural rose-brown lipstick with a satin finish. Small stud earrings are visible on her ear. She wears a glossy black high-neck futuristic couture coat or jacket with a smooth leather-like or synthetic sheen, structured shoulders, angular seams, and reflective highlights along the collar, chest, and sleeves. The garment catches cool blue and warm orange light, creating metallic-looking specular streaks across its surface. Her posture is upright and composed, with her body angled slightly toward the viewer’s left while her face turns back toward the camera, giving the portrait a fashion-editorial tension.

The environment is a dense urban street at night, rendered with strong shallow depth of field. The background is heavily blurred into bokeh, with tall building facades, illuminated windows, neon signs, and streetlights forming soft blocks of color behind the subject. On the left side, a bright cyan-white streetlamp glows near the upper-middle area, producing a strong halo and rim light along the woman’s hair and shoulder. Warm amber and orange lights appear on the right side and lower background, contrasting with teal-blue shadows throughout the scene. The pavement appears wet or slick, reflecting streaks of orange, red, blue, and white light in elongated blurred patches near the bottom of the frame. Several pedestrians occupy the background as out-of-focus silhouettes: one blurred figure walks along the lower-left edge, another darker figure appears in the mid-right background, and additional indistinct people are scattered deeper in the street. Their forms are soft and motion-blurred, reinforcing the sense of movement around the sharply focused subject.

The composition uses a low-to-eye-level camera angle and a portrait-oriented frame, with the woman’s face placed near the upper central third and her shoulders filling much of the lower half. The lighting is dramatic and cinematic, combining cool cyan rim light from the left with warm orange practical light from the right and background. The color grading emphasizes teal-and-orange contrast, high dynamic range, and moody noir atmosphere. The image has a realistic photographic style with fashion-advertising polish, shallow-focus lens characteristics, visible bokeh, soft background compression, and detailed skin and fabric texture on the main subject.", "wh_ratio": "4:5"}
